title: mom
---
<<if $handing == true>>
    <<jump mom_gave_candy>>
<<endif>>

<<if $talk == true and $handing == false>>
    <<jump mom_not_give>>
<<endif>>
<<if not visited("mom")>>
    Mom: Sweetie, are you sure you don't want me to accompany you tonight?
    -> No, Mom! Everyone else is trick or treating by themselves.
        Me: No, Mom! Everyone else is trick or treating by themselves.
        Me: I don't want to be known as the kid who needed his mom to trick or treat with him..
        Mom: Okay, honey..No worries...Just make sure you stay safe.
        Mom: Oh, and be home before 10!
        Me: Okay, Mom. Anything else?
        Mom: Yes. She leans down and kisses your cheek.
        Me: Mom!
    -> Mom, I can't, everyone will think I'm lame.
        Me: Mom, I can't, everyone will think I'm lame.
        Mom: Aww, come on, we do it every year!
        Me: No, I'm grown now! I'm 14!
        She exhales.
        Mom: Okay, fine.
        Mom: But please don't get into any trouble.
        Me: Yes! Thank you!
        Mom: One more thing. She leans down and kisses your cheek.
        Mom: Be home before 10.
        Me: Ugh.
    <<play_sfx2 game 0>>
    The doorbell rings.
    Mom: Pat, go hand the kids some candy on your way out.
    Me: Do I have to?
    Mom: Yes. Now go.
<<endif>>
===
title: kid1
---
<<set $talk = true>> 
Kid 1: Trick or treat!
<<if $candy > 0>>
    Give candy?
    -> Yes
        <<set $candy = $candy - 1>>
        <<set $handing = true>>
        Kid 1: YAY! Thanks for the candy!
    -> No
        Kid 1:  Where's the candy?
        Me: Sorry, but I want my own candy.
<<elseif $candy == 0>>
   Me: Sorry kids, no candy here.
<<endif>>
===

title: kid2
---
<<set $talk = true>>
Kid 2: Trick or treat!
    <<if $candy > 0>>
    Kid 2: Happy Halloween!
     Give candy?
    -> No
        Me: Sorry kid, no candy.
        Kid 2: WAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
    -> Yes
        <<set $candy = $candy - 1>>
        <<set $handing = true>>
        Me: Here's some candy.
        Kid 2: Thank you!!
<<elseif $candy == 0>>
   Me: Sorry kids, no candy here.
<<endif>>
===

title: mom_gave_candy
---
Me: Ma, I handed them candy.
Mom: Thanks, honey. Now, go get all the candy you can carry.
===

title: mom_not_give
---
Me: Sorry Ma, but I gotta go now. No time to give out candy.
Mom: Oh, so no trick or treating for you, I guess.
Me: Ugh, fine!
===

title: Guy
---
Guy: Yo what's up i'm Guy. <<once>>
<<if $collectables > 3>>
    Guy: I'm a loving maching but I want your money.
    <<set $collectables = $collectables -3>>
    <<endif>>
Guy: I love everyone equally.
<<if visited("Smosh")>>
    <<jump Guy_visited_Smosh>>
<<else>>
Guy: I love the world.
<<jump  Guy_NotVisited_Smosh>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Smosh
---
Smosh: SHUT UP!
<<if $good>>
    Smosh: I'm glad you're good tho
<<elseif $notgood>>
    Smosh: Why are you not good?
<<endif>>
===

title: Guy_NotVisited_Smosh
---
Guy: How are you?
-> Good
    <<set $good = true>>
-> Not good
    <<set $notgood = true>>
===

title: Guy_visited_Smosh
---
Guy: That guy is so mean.
===

title: Info
---
<<declare $candy = 0>>
you have {$candy} candy!
<<declare $collectables = 0>>
you have {$collectables} collectables!
===